# Intentionally-empty NuGet fallback folder.
#
# Directory.Build.props points UWPNugetRepo here so that
# Microsoft.NETCore.UniversalWindowsPlatform / runtime.win10-* resolve from the
# ADO feed instead of the machine-local, SDK-versioned Windows SDK copy (whose
# per-machine signature makes committed lock hashes mismatch across dev/CI -> NU1403).
# Build-time .NET Native injection is unaffected; it reads the SDK folder directly.
